    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your sword, strengthen your feet and\u00a0prepare for an unrelenting fight as you play as a samurai who must continue the journey in this fast-paced hack-and-slash survival game. Level up and gain new abilities to increase your chances of survival and\u00a0enhance your combat style to fit your playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty System: Want to test your mettle? Try out the different difficulties.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New Samurai:\u00a0Prove your skill and unlock new characters to choose from and play, each one with their own unique style of fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets: Equip unique trinkets to tweak your ronin's stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you fall into despair, or will your blade\u00a0carve a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613790/extras/f9560f9de3a45770e81456f770089bca.poster.avif?t=1754944373\" width=601 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613790/extras/f9560f9de3a45770e81456f770089bca.webm?t=1754944373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your sword, strengthen your feet and\u00a0prepare for an unrelenting fight as you play as a samurai who must continue the journey in this fast-paced hack-and-slash survival game. Level up and gain new abilities to increase your chances of survival and\u00a0enhance your combat style to fit your playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty System: Want to test your mettle? Try out the different difficulties.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New Samurai:\u00a0Prove your skill and unlock new characters to choose from and play, each one with their own unique style of fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets: Equip unique trinkets to tweak your ronin's stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you fall into despair, or will your blade\u00a0carve a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613790/extras/f9560f9de3a45770e81456f770089bca.poster.avif?t=1754944373\" width=601 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613790/extras/f9560f9de3a45770e81456f770089bca.webm?t=1754944373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Pixel Ronin is a fast-paced hack-and-slash survival game where you face relentless waves of ghouls and monsters. Tap into powerful abilities and unleash devastating attacks. Outmaneuver your enemies with tactical precision to turn the tide of battle. Hold your ground\u2014this will be a long battle.",
